  "description": "Presenting a vintage creative font set – Musical Box. It’s a 3d 3D-rendered high-quality typeface in the style of vintage brass musical equipment. First of all, it’s a color bitmap OpenType-SVG font that can be used as a usual OTF font. Also, a set of full-resolution PNG files with transparent backgrounds is included (Average resolution is 10 megapixels). Considering that only English language and basic punctuation are supported, please check out the screenshot with all available characters.\nPlease keep in mind that it’s quite a new technology and it has some software limitations. But most of the popular apps, like Adobe Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign, Procreate, Affinity Designer, etc. do support color fonts.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Presenting a vintage creative font set – Musical Box. It’s a 3d 3D-rendered high-quality typeface in the style of vintage brass musical equipment. First of all, it’s a color bitmap OpenType-SVG font that can be used as a usual OTF font. Also, a set of full-resolution PNG files with transparent backgrounds is included (Average resolution is 10 megapixels). Considering that only English language and basic punctuation are supported, please check out the screenshot with all available characters.</p>\n<p>Please keep in mind that it’s quite a new technology and it has some software limitations. But most of the popular apps, like Adobe Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign, Procreate, Affinity Designer, etc. do support color fonts.</p>",
